WEBVTT

00:00:01.107 --> 00:00:11.265
Commands in this tutorial are shown from the README and are not executed in the recording; CI runs them on every push.

00:00:11.315 --> 00:00:19.801
Debian and Ubuntu: add the repository, then apt install tezaur. It is unsigned, hence trusted=yes.

00:00:19.851 --> 00:00:28.805
Fedora and RHEL: download the .repo file, then dnf install tezaur (gpgcheck is off for the same reason).

00:00:28.855 --> 00:00:38.677
Flatpak: add the remote and install tf.trom.Tezaur. On Android, add the F-Droid repository URL in the F-Droid app.

00:00:38.727 --> 00:00:48.681
Or build from source with cargo. This one is really executed here: the version of the binary used in all these tutorials.
